      "file": "tests/fixtures/luau-shield001/vulnerable/admin-check-compared-with-nil.server.luau",
      "fix": "Missing: a type check, a lower bound, an upper bound and NaN rejection. Let the server decide amounts (look prices and rewards up in a server table by an allow-listed id). If a number must come from the client, check `typeof(x) == \"number\"`, reject NaN (`x ~= x`) and check both bounds before using it. Never use client data as a DataStore key.",
